message: "If you use this thesis, please cite it as below."
type: thesis
title: "Исследование влияния эмпатии в больших языковых моделях в процессе принятия решений в теории игр"
authors:
  - family-names: "Макарова"
    given-names: "Алексей Владимирович"
date-released: 2024-06-25
institution:
  name: "Национальный исследовательский технологический университет «МИСИС»"
  city: "Москва"
  country: "RU"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ivanmakovetskiy/diplom"
keywords:
  - empathy
  - large language models
  - LLM
  - decision making
  - game theory
  - alignment
  - cooperative behavior
abstract: >-
  Master's thesis (in Russian) investigating how empathy and emotions embedded in
  large language models change decision-making strategies and outcomes in
  game-theoretic scenarios (Dictator Game, Prisoner's Dilemma, Public Goods Game)
  and ethical benchmarks. An emotional-prompting framework is proposed and evaluated
  across proprietary and open-weight models in a multilingual setting.
